<Balagan title="Earn Balagan tokens">
<h1>Play. Place. Earn.</h1>
<p>One wallet across Balagan’s games and Thiskicks. Buy tokens or earn them through the activities below.</p>
<nav aria-label="Reward guide"><a href="#wemember">Wemember</a><a href="#sorriest">Sorriest</a><a href="#barara">Barara</a><a href="#thiskicks">Thiskicks</a></nav>
<section id="wemember"><h2>Wemember</h2><p><strong>Play</strong> · First challenge free each UTC day, then 15 tokens. Hosting is free.</p><p><strong>Earn</strong> · First 15, second 8, third 5 tokens. Recall correct details to qualify. Accuracy decides rank, then answer speed.</p><a href="https://wemember.balagan.live/">Open Wemember</a></section>
<section id="sorriest"><h2>Sorriest</h2><p><strong>Play</strong> · 20 tokens per contest. Browsing is free.</p><p><strong>Earn</strong> · Places 1–3 receive 20 each, 4–7 receive 10 each, 8–9 receive 8 each, and 10th receives 5. Apologies need votes. Equal votes use a preassigned random order.</p><a href="https://sorriest.balagan.live/">Open Sorriest</a></section>
<section id="barara"><h2>Barara</h2><p><strong>Play</strong> · 30 tokens per playing seat, including host, opponent and jurors.</p><p><strong>Earn</strong> · Winner receives 20. Each juror who voted for the winning side receives 15. At least three ballots and a winning side are required.</p><a href="https://bar.ara.balagan.live/">Open Barara</a></section>
<section id="thiskicks"><h2>Thiskicks</h2><p><strong>Publish</strong> · First pitch free, then 30 tokens. Comments and voting are free.</p><p><strong>Earn monthly</strong> · 1st 350; 2nd–3rd 280 each; 4th–10th 230 each; 11th–25th 100 each; 26th–50th 30 each.</p><p>Closes at 02:00 UTC+3 on the first of each month. One winning pitch per creator. Only pitches and eligible signed-in votes from that period count. Exact ties share the combined prizes, rounded down. Self-votes, anonymous votes and zero-vote pitches are excluded.</p><a href="https://thiskicks.balagan.live/leaderboard">Monthly standings and rules</a></section>
<p>Rewards go into your shared wallet and remain until spent. Subscription refills expire monthly. Rewards are app tokens and have no cash withdrawal.</p>
<a class="button" href="/wallet">Open wallet</a>
</Balagan>
